calendar.description:
Primary calendar: auto-synced to all bookings. Secondary calendars: optional per-booking selection in the panel.

Current primary: {current_primary}
Secondary: {current_secondary}

CalDAV deletion: {caldav_status}. Fill in the CalDAV fields below if your primary/secondary calendars are iCloud/Nextcloud/CalDAV calendars — Home Assistant's CalDAV integration can create events but cannot delete them, so MieleLogic needs its own CalDAV login to remove events when a booking is cancelled. Leave blank if your calendars support deletion through Home Assistant already (e.g. Local Calendar, Google Calendar).
